   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "MEASURED COMPLETE-CHAIN RECALL\nPrimary 2Wiki bridge cohort\n\nCandidate pool, K=40\nFlat: 41/60 = 68.3%\nGraph: 60/60 = 100.0%\n\nFinal evidence, K=5\nFlat: 38/60 = 63.3%\nGraph: 50/60 = 83.3%\n\nFinal gain: +20.0 percentage points\n95% paired bootstrap: +6.7 to +33.3\nExact McNemar p = 0.0118",
   "originalText": "MEASURED COMPLETE-CHAIN RECALL\nPrimary 2Wiki bridge cohort\n\nCandidate pool, K=40\nFlat: 41/60 = 68.3%\nGraph: 60/60 = 100.0%\n\nFinal evidence, K=5\nFlat: 38/60 = 63.3%\nGraph: 50/60 = 83.3%\n\nFinal gain: +20.0 percentage points\n95% paired bootstrap: +6.7 to +33.3\nExact McNemar p = 0.0118",
