   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Why gold labels are necessary\nRetrieval returns paragraph IDs. Gold labels tell the evaluator which IDs were required.\nThey make the result measurable without helping either retriever find the passages.",
   "originalText": "Why gold labels are necessary\nRetrieval returns paragraph IDs. Gold labels tell the evaluator which IDs were required.\nThey make the result measurable without helping either retriever find the passages.",
